--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ce1d3326426d8413f86dce414ff780b1, type: 3}
  m_Name: Vivian_Diner_P2_Phase1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  lines:
  - speaker: You
    text: You told me you were home all night. But I found this note in your room.
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 035e10dcc6ffb4506b2d69f521460b1b, type: 3}
  - speaker: Vivian Rose
    text: ...where did you ... that's private.
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b772191a5b62c4213af7d916d4de6f18, type: 3}
  - speaker: You
    text: Private or not, it puts you somewhere other than home. Care to explain?
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 035e10dcc6ffb4506b2d69f521460b1b, type: 3}
  - speaker: Vivian Rose
    text: Fine. I went. I wanted to talk to him, one last time, before it was really
      over. That's all. I didn't like the fact that I didn't try to keep us ...
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b772191a5b62c4213af7d916d4de6f18, type: 3}
  - speaker: You
    text: You didn't think that was worth mentioning?
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 035e10dcc6ffb4506b2d69f521460b1b, type: 3}
  - speaker: Vivian Rose
    text: Don't you think I look stupid for going after him after he dumped me? I
      was desperate, is that something worth admitting?
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b772191a5b62c4213af7d916d4de6f18, type: 3}
  - speaker: You
    text: It's looking worse now that you hid it.
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 035e10dcc6ffb4506b2d69f521460b1b, type: 3}
  - speaker: Vivian Rose
    text: ... I know.
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b772191a5b62c4213af7d916d4de6f18, type: 3}
  - speaker: You
    text: Anyways, how's everything going around here, now that Marco's gone?
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 035e10dcc6ffb4506b2d69f521460b1b, type: 3}
  - speaker: Vivian Rose
    text: Not great, no one here knows how to cook like he did.
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b772191a5b62c4213af7d916d4de6f18, type: 3}
  - speaker: You
    text: You opened the diner, why didn't you take over?
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 035e10dcc6ffb4506b2d69f521460b1b, type: 3}
  - speaker: Vivian Rose
    text: I can't cook, I just love food.
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b772191a5b62c4213af7d916d4de6f18, type: 3}
  - speaker: You
    text: Well that's new. Good luck around here!
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 035e10dcc6ffb4506b2d69f521460b1b, type: 3}
